   Can someone define "indestructible" for me, in a Nethack context?
I thought the only ways to destroy things in Nethack were:

* eating (works for pretty much anything)
* BoH explosion or cursed BoH (works for anything that can be bagged)
* rotting (doesn't apply to metal objects)
* breaking glass (doesn't apply to metal objects)
* disappearing thrown weapons (doesn't apply to artifacts)
* polymorph (dunno whether you can polymorph Mjollnir or not)
* stone to flesh (doesn't apply to metal objects)

So, what qualifies an object as "indestructible", given that it's
/hard/ to destroy most items, and probably not /impossible/ to
destroy any item?

